[tools/validator/parse] Parse reviewed descriptions (notstarted)
Files: validator parser implementation and parser fixtures named at dispatch.
Do: Implement the reviewed grammar exactly, with source locations on rejection and no recovery or accepted dialects. Preserve extension namespaces and values byte-exactly where the grammar requires it.
Accept: Every reviewed production parses into one internal form; malformed input fails with a location and identifier where available; no parser behavior is invented locally.
-> grammar/review
