[tools/validator/structure] Validate structural invariants (notstarted)
Files: validator structural checks and fixtures named at dispatch.
Do: Implement address uniqueness, directed two-port connections, core-version declaration, one definition site, grammar conformance, reference scope, locality, legal unreferenced elements, layer-input DAG resolution, and extension-namespace preservation.
Accept: Each failure names its check, location, and relevant identifier; valid ties are accepted without warnings; C1-C10 fixtures cover both success and failure.
-> schemas/instances
-> tools/validator/parse
