[tools/validator/serialize] Serialize canonical descriptions (notstarted)
Files: validator canonical serializer and round-trip fixtures named at dispatch.
Do: Emit the grammar's canonical serialization with deterministic ordering and byte-preserving extension values. Assert parse(serialize(parse(x))) value preservation and serialize(parse(x)) fixpoint behavior over all valid fixtures.
Accept: Both serializer properties hold for every valid fixture; serializer failures identify the source value or fixture that violates the property.
-> grammar/review
-> tools/validator/parse
