Do: Extract downward-closed layer subsets as standalone descriptions, revalidate each erasure, and report a non-cut subset as unresolvable at the layers whose declared inputs are absent.
Accept: C11 successful transformations and C12 visible unresolvable outcomes are fixtures; extraction never silently retains an absent input or crashes.
